// Prologue, in medias res (SPEC §3.5 v1.1; decisions_log N-20, N-21). The party keeps its vigils
// apart in the drowned plaza of a dead city at dusk; Rhen's older voice says the one line, then the
// story cuts back to the beach where it begins (M2-FP-03 hands off to ch02/haluna at Beach).
// Grade intent: color script `prologue_iskarra_dusk` (no grade cue exists for it yet).
// Shots: P01 is a fixed wide on the plaza, the towers behind, the sun low on the left. P02 is the
// two-shot on the rise, Rhen beside Asha, that P01 drifts into while he crosses to her.
// M2-FP-103 (act_outline "The Last Time"): Rhen crosses the plaza to Asha on the steps and the line
// lands as his lantern catches, the only flame in the frame; glimmer rises around him. His sit and
// trim_wicks clips are on Character's list (requested_clips.json, M3-CHR-01): add them here when built.
// The line is the human-approved text (ADR 0020 §(g)); never reword it here.
title: prologue_dead_city
location: prologue
---
// The human's playtest (2026-10-30, "New Game starts in the underwater sequence"): the prologue played, but as 20 s
// with one line it didn't read as one. It opens on its title card on black, and P01 holds the dead city before
// Rhen crosses (the establishing beat).
Prologue #line:prologue_dead_city_000 #card #tn:"Title card, centred on black, before the first frame of the game."
@letterbox on
@camera P01
@light LanternLight off
@anim ysolde vigil_book_shut
@fade in 3.0
@wait 3.5
@mark rhen by_asha walk
@camera P02 blend=7.0 ease=in_out_sine
@anim rhen look_at asha
@wait 1.0
@light LanternLight on 1.4
@wait 0.6
Narrator(rhen) [tender]: Everyone I'm going to tell you about is still here tonight. Remember that, later. #line:prologue_dead_city_001 #vo
@vfx glimmer_lift at=by_asha count=12
@wait 4.0
@fade out 2.5
@letterbox off
===
